    "formula_steps": [
      "Use exactly the 240 continuous-session close observations c_1..c_240 at 09:31-11:30 and 13:01-15:00; preserve but exclude the standalone 09:30 source row.",
      "Require every close c_t to be finite and strictly positive, then form 239 adjacent log returns r_t=log(c_t/c_(t-1)), including 11:30 to 13:01.",
      "Set s_t=1 when r_t>0, s_t=-1 when r_t<0, and s_t=0 when r_t=0.",
      "Across the 238 adjacent sign pairs, let N_pp count s_(t-1)=1 and s_t=1, and let N_nn count s_(t-1)=-1 and s_t=-1. Pairs involving zero or opposite signs contribute to neither count.",
      "Return (N_pp-N_nn)/(N_pp+N_nn) only when N_pp+N_nn is strictly positive."
    ],
    "formula": "(N_pp - N_nn) / (N_pp + N_nn), where N_pp and N_nn count adjacent ++ and -- pairs among the 239 continuous-session close log-return signs",
